; spu CellOS Lv-2 options.


msputhread
Target Report
CellOS Lv-2 SPU Thread.

mspuraw
Target Report
CellOS Lv-2 Raw SPU.

mspuisolatedmodule
Target Report
CellOS Lv-2 Isolated SPU Module.


